{"reviews":[{"id":"B08X75R4JL-0","r":1.0,"t":"Save your money","x":"Sure it's easy to use, but it doesn't work anything like it's advertised! Doesn't draw dirt/oils from skin and definitely doesn't pull them out in a way that shows through the mask like the video shows. Doesn't shrink pores either. I would not recommend this product.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-1","r":1.0,"t":"It doesn't work irritates skin","x":"If I could do so it would be no stars I wasted my time using this product and it does nothing it says in video it portrays thumbs down I want my money back","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-2","r":1.0,"t":"False advertising!","x":"After watching the have anything to do with that advertisement I thought it would work like it did on the advertisement but it didn't.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-3","r":2.0,"t":"Moisturizes skin but false advertising.","x":"Review shows the green tea mask cleansing pores by revealing black heads from skin within what seems like seconds. Well i tried it first for 3 min and nothing. Second time 10 minutes. There were no nasty black heads or exposed poors that i could magically wipe away and skin look even 5x\u2019s better. Skin looks the same, feels slightly smoother little irritation after. I do not recommend to anyone wanting to use this to cleanse or remove any blackheads.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-4","r":5.0,"t":"Very effective in removing blackheads","x":"I have used a lot of masks and this mask is probably one of the best masks I have used. So I left 5 stars here. It is very effective in removing my dead skin and blackheads. It has completely changed my face and made my face look healthier!!!!!!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-5","r":1.0,"t":"No","x":"It doesn\u2019t work, waste of money, I did everything I was supposed I waited for more than 15 min in my second time using it, but it didn\u2019t work. I will not recommend this product to anyone","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-6","r":1.0,"t":"horrible","x":"If I could give it zero stars I would have. It actually made my face break out and become extremely dry. It was an absolute waste of money and am never going to purchase again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-7","r":1.0,"t":"Nooo!!!!","x":"Do NOT BUY!! I purchased it to help with blackheads and hyperpigmentation and it does not work. Don\u2019t waste your money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-8","r":1.0,"t":"IT DOESN\u2019T WORK","x":"This product doesn\u2019t do what it says it does. The videos are a joke. Don\u2019t waste your money.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-9","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Did nothing but break my face out. Very disappointed with this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-10","r":1.0,"t":"didn't work and smells weird","x":"the fact the outside looked dirty and that it smells like chemicals","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-11","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work","x":"Lol was worth a shot but def never buying again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-12","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s not as advertised","x":"It was ok but it didn\u2019t work as advertised.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-13","r":1.0,"t":"It's seller is untruthful","x":"This product only works for people that already have a clear face. And this is the truth. when you put it on, it makes you look like you have toothpaste all over your face in  a light green color  And it does not get rid of blackheads and does not do what it says! On the video!! Not at all!!  (it's  A lie!. It's a nasty trick to  get you to buy it.  It's only worth a dollar or less!! Be honest with what you sell. Ripping  customers  off is no different than  stealing.!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-14","r":3.0,"t":"Not as advertised, but still useful.","x":"I like the ease of using this product. No messy hands or open containers in baggies laying around. Easy to travel with and easy to use. All the directions are in Japanese. Does not suck blackheads out like video shows. I did not expect it too. My face does seem smoother. If you over use it will dry your skin out though. I have noticed less new blackheads/acne.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-15","r":3.0,"t":"Not as advertised, but still useful.","x":"I like the ease of using this product. No messy hands or open containers in baggies laying around. Easy to travel with and easy to use. All the directions are in Japanese. Does not suck blackheads out like video shows. I did not expect it too. My face does seem smoother. If you over use it will dry your skin out though. I have noticed less new blackheads/acne.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-16","r":1.0,"t":"Does not work as advertised.  Containers much smaller than shown in pix.","x":"Promoted to be special mask that sucks the blackheads out of your skin.  It's just a normal mask.  Nothing special at all AND, the scale of product pictured, does not reflect the size of the items (2 pack) I received.  Pix look almost like they are the size of deodorant stick, when in fact they're more the size of a large lip gloss.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-17","r":4.0,"t":"First use, seems good.","x":"Has lots of bad reviews.  But, simple and easy to use.  My face feels clean and smooth.  My pores look smaller.  Maybe not the miracle product as advertised but seems like a simple safe solution to my oily, porous skin.  First time I've used and I'm happy with results","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-18","r":3.0,"t":"Easy to use and works well","x":"I used it once and it pulled some blackheads out, pulled a pimple that just showed up today to the surface to pop, caused redness in my face from pulling everything up. Very satisfied in how easy it is to use and the results I have seen in one day.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-19","r":1.0,"t":"This product is misleading","x":"This is suppose to extract black heads and oily dirt from the skin in minutes. I  tried it and it did nothing like the videos and advertisements claimed it did. I wish I could get my money back. DONT ORDER THIS CRAP","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-20","r":5.0,"t":"Use with good friends","x":"A great mask, best used on acne-prone faces. It makes my face cleaner and moisturized, and acne and blackheads are gradually reduced. I gave a bottle of facial mask to my good friend, she also likes it very much","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-21","r":5.0,"t":"This makes my face soft","x":"Just kidding, I think it is a normal mask. After I used it, I found that I was wrong. It is very convenient to use. After 10 minutes of washing, my face becomes smooth and I feel that my acne is reduced again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-22","r":1.0,"t":"To stick or not to stick?","x":"I was expecting a mask stick, easy to apply on my face. I got a small jar with liquid clay mask. I wasn't able to use it. To expensive. No user guidelines in English. Would not recommend. I have send it back.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-23","r":1.0,"t":"Be careful what you see online!","x":"I was excited to see a product that cleans out your pores.  When I got it I tried it immediately.  I was HIGHLY disappointed.  This product is NOT what you see on Tiktok or Facebook.  Waste of money!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08X75R4JL-24","r":3.0,"t":"Not as advertised","x":"A good product for pore cleansing. Note: does not work in the extreme fashion that it is advertised (you will not see dirt coming out of your skin) Still is a great mask though.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Most reviewers say the product does not work as advertised, especially failing to remove blackheads or draw out dirt/oils like the video shows.","cites":[1,2,3,4,6,8,9,12,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many reviewers call it a waste of money and say they would not recommend or repurchase it.","cites":[1,2,6,7,8,9,10,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report skin irritation, breakouts, or excessive dryness after use.","cites":[2,7,10,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers note negative sensory issues such as a chemical smell or dirty-looking packaging.","cites":[11]},{"text":"A minority of reviewers report positive results, saying it effectively removes blackheads and dead skin and leaves skin smoother or healthier.","cites":[5,15]}]},"qa":[]}